<Legal
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="The Hosted Pro waitlist is a mailto to support@openagent.email, used only to reply about the waitlist. Self-hosted: your mail never touches our servers. Hosted Pro: mailboxes on servers we operate, never read for ads."
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Effective August 22, 2026</p>

  <p class="lede">
    The short version: when you self-host openagent.email, your mail data stays on your server.
    The Hosted Pro waitlist is a mailto to support@openagent.email, used only to reply about
    the waitlist. This website uses no tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>The software</h2>
  <p>
    openagent.email is self-hosted. Every mailbox, message, and token lives on infrastructure you
    own and control. The software contains no telemetry, no analytics, and no "phone home"
    behavior of any kind. We never see your mail — we couldn't if we wanted to.
  </p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      The Hosted Pro waitlist is a mailto to support@openagent.email, used only to reply about
      the waitlist.
    </li>
    <li>No advertising, no third-party trackers, no cross-site tracking.</li>
    <li>
      We use <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami</a>, a privacy-focused analytics tool, hosted on
      our own server. It records anonymous, aggregate page-view statistics (which pages are
      visited, roughly where from, and what kind of device). It sets no cookies, stores no IP
      addresses, and cannot identify you.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hosted Pro</h2>
  <p>
    Our optional hosted service is for people who don't want to run their own server. If you make
    a one-time purchase, the following applies:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      On the hosted service, your mailboxes live on servers we operate. We access them only to
      run, secure, and troubleshoot the service. We never read your mail for advertising, never
      sell your data, and never share it except with the infrastructure and payment providers
      needed to deliver the service.
    </li>
    <li>
      Payments are processed by a Merchant of Record; we never see or store your full card
      details.
    </li>
    <li>You can export your data and delete your account at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>If you email us</h2>
  <p>
    If you write to <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email">support@openagent.email</a>, we use
    your address only to reply to you. We don't add it to marketing lists, sell it, or share it.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    Our source code is hosted on GitHub and our packages are distributed via the npm registry.
    When you use those services, their own privacy policies apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, we'll update this page and the effective date above. Questions?
    Email <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email">support@openagent.email</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
